      "render_instances_note": "Slice 4c render-instance expansion: each blade part is drawn 8x with its own zRot stepped by the float literal 0.7853982f (accumulated in float32), inside one pose-stack rotation of rf1 degrees about X / Y / Z per part, so the converter emits <part>__fan (group, hook-spun) over <part>__i0..7 (clones, static step); the blades of one fan overlap (bar half-width 2 > arc spacing at radius 4.4) with coplanar faces, so z-fight contests are expected; the contested fraction is reported as a diagnostic, every pixel compared (G2 root-order contract, 2026-09-06)"
